WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.080
Challenge the test with controlled faults.

00:00:02.192 --> 00:00:06.320
Duplicate posting must fail
the journal and balance assertions.

00:00:06.640 --> 00:00:10.400
A changed amount under the same key
must produce a conflict without another

00:00:10.451 --> 00:00:14.320
submission. Concurrent retries
must converge on one transfer.

00:00:14.760 --> 00:00:17.121
A repeated callback must not post again.

00:00:17.303 --> 00:00:21.280
Define these expectations
independently of the generated test.

00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:24.640
The browser demonstration
illustrates part of this behavior;

00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:27.760
service-level implementations
and retained evidence are still required.
